sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
Use `grid-template-columns` to describe the column tracks the container should create. The `fr` unit distributes available space as fractions.

```css
main {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
}
```

**Line by line:** `main {` continues styling the existing Grid container. `grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;` creates two equal column tracks, with each `1fr` receiving one fraction of the available space. The closing `}` ends the rule.

