sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
`grid-template-rows` controls explicit row tracks. `auto` lets a row size itself from its content, which is useful when the portfolio content should remain readable instead of forcing a fixed height.

```css
main {
  grid-template-rows: auto;
}
```

**Line by line:** `main {` targets the same Grid container. `grid-template-rows: auto;` creates an explicit row whose size follows its content instead of a fixed height. The closing `}` completes the rule.

